cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "An unconditional classification of length-six Salem polynomials"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An exact proof rules out Salem roots in (1, 1.01] for length-six Salem polynomials, completing the twelve-family and 126-sporadic classification of McKee and Smyth. The least Salem number admitting such a polynomial is Lehmer's number. This does not settle the unrestricted Lehmer problem."
